{# W3C SCXML 5.5 — `<script>` body. The text was rewritten from
   ECMAScript to Lua at codegen time (`to_lua_script`); the runtime
   `_exec` helper handles eval failures via `error.execution` +
   block-abort per W3C 3.8. #}
